Redface 2 v0.53.0 — dev.

- Colours: a Light / System / Dark selector right on the page, to check the preview in both themes.
- Flags: the "Soft" and "Bullet" category bands now take the chosen accent, even with the White or RF1 Grey background; the "Minimal" style tints its icon too.
- Colours: a Neutral accent or a grey hex now gives real grey instead of green.
- Topic: replying with a quote stays on the page and resumes at the quoted post; quick reply posts the page it was opened on.
